Chapter: DbBootMain
  cites Data chapter DbBoot
  cites Data chapter Catalog

 The entry point lives apart from `DbBoot` so `DbBoot` can be cited: a program
 has exactly one `opening` (CDX3001, L-UNCITABLE).

Section: Entry Point

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let config = default-db-config
    in let state = db-boot-init config
    in let state2 = bootstrap-system-tables state
    in act
      print-line-uni (db-boot-banner config)
      print-line-uni (db-health state2)
      print-line-uni ("system tables: " & catalog-stats (state2.dbs-server.db-catalog))
    end
  end

